    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workplace Hazard is a fast-paced, physics-driven 2D platformer that takes place in a dystopian future, playing the role of CRT-2 \u2014 a recycled utility bot \u2014 where crates are your life! Moving crates to 'Exit Portals' is your sacred duty, and you were created to obey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for <strong>Binary Operations</strong>, a shipping company run by an AI overlord (B.O.S.S. \u2013 Binary Operations Shipment Supervisor), who oversees an elaborate facility with questionable safety standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, your system glitches and you begin having.. memories? Things don't add up.. Maybe you weren\u2019t always a bot \u2014 and maybe B.O.S.S. isn't just a shipment supervisor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission takes you across 50 hand crafted stages; Each stage is a tightly-designed time trial packed with hazards like moving platforms, jump pads, pits, and annoying mobs. Upgrades await for you ahead, like a \u2018Bomb Pack\u2019 to blast your way through walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a groovy soundtrack, crazy physics, and lore to discover, you\u2019ll traverse radio-active factories, slummy sewers, sterile labs, and dark mine-shafts \u2014 10 mini-challenges, 4 mini-bots, and 1 final bot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages offer 2 or more minutes each, growing exponentially with progression; Stages can be replayed to master routes, find hidden VHS tapes and compete for the fastest possible completion time and get on the global high-score board.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workplace Hazard is a fast-paced, physics-driven 2D platformer that takes place in a dystopian future, playing the role of CRT-2 \u2014 a recycled utility bot \u2014 where crates are your life! Moving crates to 'Exit Portals' is your sacred duty, and you were created to obey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for <strong>Binary Operations</strong>, a shipping company run by an AI overlord (B.O.S.S. \u2013 Binary Operations Shipment Supervisor), who oversees an elaborate facility with questionable safety standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, your system glitches and you begin having.. memories? Things don't add up.. Maybe you weren\u2019t always a bot \u2014 and maybe B.O.S.S. isn't just a shipment supervisor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission takes you across 50 hand crafted stages; Each stage is a tightly-designed time trial packed with hazards like moving platforms, jump pads, pits, and annoying mobs. Upgrades await for you ahead, like a \u2018Bomb Pack\u2019 to blast your way through walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a groovy soundtrack, crazy physics, and lore to discover, you\u2019ll traverse radio-active factories, slummy sewers, sterile labs, and dark mine-shafts \u2014 10 mini-challenges, 4 mini-bots, and 1 final bot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages offer 2 or more minutes each, growing exponentially with progression; Stages can be replayed to master routes, find hidden VHS tapes and compete for the fastest possible completion time and get on the global high-score board.</p>",
    "short_description": "Are you an old CRT monitor with a penchant for picking up boxes? Do you long for the days when you could place those boxes in an exit portal and engage your jetpacks early because you're impatient? If you answered yes to any of these questions, you're really weird! But try Workplace Hazard anyway!\u00a0",
